# Beambus level 2: "The Nebula Empress"
# A denser gauntlet: faster grunts, an armored tank line, shield drops to
# survive the mid-game, and a beefier queen. Also demonstrates the player's
# life_every key: a bonus life every 8000 points.
# See docs/level-format.md for the full format.

name "The Nebula Empress"
background #141024

# focus_speed 0.5 (the default) slows the ship to half speed while Shift is
# held, trading speed for precise dodging and a tighter shot pattern.
player { speed 270 fire_rate 0.14 lives 3 life_every 8000 bombs 1 focus_speed 0.5 }

# Small fast swarmers: die in one hit.
enemy grunt { hp 1 speed 100 points 100 radius 8  fire_rate 0.5  color #e8594f }
# Heavier strafers: two hits, faster, worth more, and they fire a two-shot
# volley (shots 2 spread 0.6) so their fire reads as a quick burst.
enemy dart  { hp 2 speed 170 points 250 radius 9  fire_rate 1.2  shots 2 spread 0.6 color #7aa2f7 }
# Slow shield tanks: five hits, slow bullets.
enemy tank  { hp 5 speed 65  points 500 radius 12 fire_rate 0.35 color #c3e88d }
# Seekers: homing shots (homing true) that curve toward the ship at a capped
# rate - a persistent threat you dodge by breaking line, not by outrunning it.
enemy seeker { hp 2 speed 140 points 300 radius 9  fire_rate 0.6  homing true color #c792ea }
# The queen: a larger, harder boss that dives (pattern sweep) into the field,
# sweeps side to side, and retreats, firing a wide five-shot fan
# (shots 5 spread 1.2), so dodging close for grazes pays. Below 50% HP it
# enrages: double fire rate and a seven-way volley.
boss { at 55 kind tank hp 120 speed 42 points 8000 radius 26 fire_rate 0.9 shots 5 spread 1.2 rage_hp 0.5 pattern sweep color #ffd23f }

# Power-up drops: spread to climb the weapon tiers, shields to take a free hit,
# a bomb drop to refill the panic button, and a rapid drop for a timed
# fire-rate boost.
powerup { at 12 kind spread }
powerup { at 20 kind shield }
powerup { at 28 kind rapid }
powerup { at 34 kind spread }
powerup { at 42 kind shield }
powerup { at 50 kind spread }
powerup { at 58 kind bomb }

# Opening lull: unarmed scouts drift down so the player can warm up.
wave { at 2  kind grunt count 8  interval 0.35 pattern sine    armed false }
wave { at 8  kind dart  count 6  interval 0.4  pattern swoop   armed false }

# First armed pressure.
wave { at 14 kind grunt count 10 interval 0.25 pattern spiral  armed true }
wave { at 18 kind tank  count 4  interval 0.7  pattern drift   armed true }

# Mid-game mixed waves: the darts dive-bomb the player's column.
wave { at 24 kind dart  count 8  interval 0.3  pattern chase   armed true }
wave { at 30 kind grunt count 12 interval 0.2  pattern sine    armed true }

# The armored line.
wave { at 36 kind tank  count 6  interval 0.6  pattern orbit   armed true }

# Final swarm before the queen arrives.
wave { at 42 kind dart   count 10 interval 0.25 pattern spiral  armed true }
wave { at 45 kind seeker count 6  interval 0.35 pattern chase   armed true }
wave { at 48 kind grunt  count 14 interval 0.2  pattern swoop   armed true }
